{"3606970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Brass Rain", "steam_appid": 3606970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One of the top wishlisted games of 2026!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRASS RAIN</strong> is a combined arms combat game, inspired by real World War II events and the unforgettable stories that shaped them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRASS RAIN delivers seriously satisfying action built around authentic WWII battles.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real WWII weapons, locations, and scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close-quarters chaos and mid-range firefights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grounded enough to feel real, fast enough to stay fun</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We stick to the real WWII setting, but we’re making a game, not a simulation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606970/extras/44adae8ccf2cc97e44355d617b059529.poster.avif?t=1783689867\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606970/extras/44adae8ccf2cc97e44355d617b059529.webm?t=1783689867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606970/extras/44adae8ccf2cc97e44355d617b059529.mp4?t=1783689867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Designed Battlefields</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These aren’t just pretty maps, they’re built to be played.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normandy cliffs of Pointe du Hoc and Castle Itter perched in the Austrian Alps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple routes, flanks, and vertical angles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trenches, interiors, and open kill zones</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Operation Mode: Asymmetrical Warfare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is where things get interesting: each side has a different job, and no, you don’t know the opponent’s mission</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attackers push objectives, defenders hold the line</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objectives shift as the match unfolds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordination beats raw aim</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Pointe du Hoc, one team hunts down hidden artillery while the other tries to stop them, however they can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606970/extras/cebb240547189837a3b34fc58930b0d4.poster.avif?t=1783689867\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606970/extras/cebb240547189837a3b34fc58930b0d4.webm?t=1783689867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606970/extras/cebb240547189837a3b34fc58930b0d4.mp4?t=1783689867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect at Launch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are launching as a multiplayer infantry &amp; tanks combat game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focused set of maps based on real battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core PvP modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ongoing updates, balance, and improvements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beyond That</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re building BRASS RAIN for the long run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From infantry and tanks, Brass Rain will expand into larger battles with more vehicles: aircraft &amp; naval.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that’s not the focus right now. First, we get infantry &amp; tanks combat right… incredibly satisfying to shoot and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist BRASS RAIN to stay updated!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606970/extras/0c84f22fc1e1f2d1cc9336d23742c256.poster.avif?t=1783689867\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606970/extras/0c84f22fc1e1f2d1cc9336d23742c256.webm?t=1783689867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606970/extras/0c84f22fc1e1f2d1cc9336d23742c256.mp4?t=1783689867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One of the top wishlisted games of 2026!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRASS RAIN</strong> is a combined arms combat game, inspired by real World War II events and the unforgettable stories that shaped them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRASS RAIN delivers seriously satisfying action built around authentic WWII battles.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real WWII weapons, locations, and scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close-quarters chaos and mid-range firefights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph